  "subTitleDesc": null,
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程圖學及輔助軟體應用",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING GRAPHICS AND AUTOCAD LEARNING",
    "describe_ch": "了解製圖之原理並具備識圖能力，課程包含說明圖說中常用之各類符號線條意義.簡單立體圖,正規三視六視圖及透視圖等之介紹及練習，同時導入AutoCAD軟體並透過實際環工工程藍圖進行解說及臨摹以訓練實務識圖能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides students with an appreciation and understanding of the principles of engineering graphics. The following topics will be introduced to the students: basics of engineering graphics, geometry, 3-view and 6-view projections, dimension-labeling, cross-section projections, and reading of blue prints of environmental projects. The course not only focuses on hands drawing but also on Auto CAM learning in class.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "認識工程圖之基本性質及重要性\t",
      "describe_en": "Know the basic properties and importance of engineering graphics"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "運用正投影之原理，畫出簡單物件之六視及剖面圖\t",
      "describe_en": "Apply the principal of orthographic projection and draw the six principal and profile views of simple-shaped objects."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "運用基本幾何作圖之原理\t",
      "describe_en": "Apply the principal of geometrical drawing technique."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "理解如何讀懂工程相關領域之設計圖\t",
      "describe_en": "Learn the skills and techniques needed to comprehend the contents in blue prints relating to engineering."
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "學習運用Auto CAD軟體進行工程圖繪製",
      "describe_en": "Draw a blue print with the aid of Auto CAD"
    }
  ],
